        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HORDE FROM HELL</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How long can you survive in this <i>classic round based</i> shooter?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Made with love and passion from a solo developer.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-- FEATURES --</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 hand crafted maps (With plans for more!).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilate the horde with seven unique weapons + an always persistent melee.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapon to show the zombies who's boss.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the upper hand by purchasing perks and armor from the terminal trading system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck for a random weapon by rolling the <i>box</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind for all available achievements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What other secrets can you uncover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HORDE FROM HELL</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How long can you survive in this <i>classic round based</i> shooter?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Made with love and passion from a solo developer.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-- FEATURES --</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 hand crafted maps (With plans for more!).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilate the horde with seven unique weapons + an always persistent melee.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapon to show the zombies who's boss.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the upper hand by purchasing perks and armor from the terminal trading system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck for a random weapon by rolling the <i>box</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind for all available achievements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What other secrets can you uncover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Blast through zombies in this classic wave based shooter. With three maps to make your last stand, how long can you survive?",
